{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Begin your epic adventure as you &quot;Journey Up&quot; towards t</strong>he sky</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey deep in a mine with no memories in your databanks or directives in your programming. The only thing you see is a glimmer of light far above you beneath a collapsed mine shaft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each jump and hand hold takes you closer to your goal. Explore different biomes and face different challenges as you journey up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore diverse biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144110/extras/JU_Biomes.gif?t=1743995721\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each biome presents new sights and challenges on your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Singleplayer or online multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144110/extras/JU_Multiplayer.gif?t=1743995721\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether playing offline on your own or online with upto 4 players you can be sure to have good latency with our cloud based servers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realistic body physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144110/extras/JU_Physics.gif?t=1743995721\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We model the whole body with our physics system so you can swing with your arms or slide things with your feet and push buttons by physically slapping them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2 Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on easy mode and you can respawn at your highest checkpoint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on speedrun mode to disable checkpoints and try for the fastest finish time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compare individual zone times and whole game complete times with your friends on steam leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[New] Arm locomotion option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VR or Desktop Mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Motion controls or Keyboard Mouse or Gamepad support.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full body physics simulation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull yourself onto ledges by pushing your hands down and raising your legs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144110/extras/gorilla.gif?t=1743995721\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether adventuring solo or with up to 4 players online, keep journeying upwards... and don't look down!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deep Well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/d374ae6a42e66df2c53418249b10c3da12907f0d.jpg"},{"name":"Zip line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/a724b3d269f3c15d41ec766ddef2ebcc0335c42c.jpg"},{"name":"The Mines","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/8da8b6556d5ddd02c2b061b6303c4afcf3ac631f.jpg"},{"name":"Surface","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/be82c09ecf1d1c63b5be8026f54a8df3a13ac3b6.jpg"},{"name":"Leap of faith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/9e23fb09a0c789c423bc7615a23c636fa258eb19.jpg"},{"name":"Push Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144110/9fa660946ec610311abdc4b6d303be6